OL,3,GNEWSAResidents fear parking 'nightmare'
OL,4,Aafter beauty spot reopens
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople living near a Greater Manchester
OL,7,Fbeauty spot fear a return to a
OL,8,F"nightmare" of car-jammed roads and
OL,9,Flitter after the area reopened
OL,10,Ffollowing a wildfire.
OL,12,FDove Stone reservoir, near Greenfield
OL,13,Fin Oldham reopened last week after the
OL,14,Fblaze burned for more than three weeks.
OL,16,FResidents said the area had previously
OL,17,Fbeen plagued by obstructed roads, while
OL,18,Fvisitors also left litter and lit
OL,19,Fbarbecues, raising concerns about
OL,20,Faccess for emergency vehicles - and now
OL,21,Fthey fear a return of the same issues.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,410,400,260,160,0,100
