OL,3,GNEWSAResidents fear parking 'nightmare'
OL,4,Aafter beauty spot reopens
OL,5,
OL,6,FOldham Council said wardens patrolled
OL,7,Fthe area and issued 946 penalty charge
OL,8,Fnotices around the reservoir in 2025.
OL,9,FThe RSPB, which manages the
OL,10,Fattraction's car park, said it
OL,11,Funderstood the concerns.
